# Palm-reading photographs — biometric data stored on local disk (see
# src/lib/palm/storage.ts, PALM_UPLOAD_DIR), never committed.
/uploads/

# Gita chant audio — 701 MP3s (~57MB), served from disk (see gita.routes.ts),
